+@ The same words as Oak's and Elm's (rom/patches/oakle.patch, rom/crystal/patches/oakle-crystal.patch), in a two-line box
+Oakle_Text_Greeting:
+	.string "BIRCH: {PLAYER}!\n"
+	.string "Prepare your team\l"
+	.string "to battle me!\p"
+	.string "Talk to me when\n"
+	.string "you are ready.$"
+
+Oakle_Text_ShowMe:
+	.string "BIRCH: Show me what you've got,\n"
+	.string "{PLAYER}!$"
+
+Oakle_Text_Defeat:
+	.string "BIRCH: Hmm! Well played,\n"
+	.string "{PLAYER}!$"
 
